  "description": "I-RES is delighted to bring to market this superb UNFURNISHED 2-bedroom apartment in the sought after Charlestown Place. One bedroom property to let in one of the best apartment complexes in North Dublin. Charlestown is located off St. Margaret\\'s Road in Finglas, south of the M50 Motorway and within easy access of Dublin Airport and Dublin City Centre.\n\nThe property consists of open plan kitchen /living with balcony access, large double bedroom, main bathroom and storage. Adverts may vary in photos.\n\nCharlestown Place boasts views of Dublin City and the Wicklow Mountains with a sunny aspect. The development has a secure underground parking space if required at an extra cost per month. Charlestown is convenient to a multitude of amenities including an excellent array of shops, restaurants, cafes, schools, colleges & Dublin City University, local parks, sports & leisure facilities, good bus routes with a Quality Bus Corridor to the city centre.\n\nServices at Charlestown include: - Dedicated property manager - Full time maintenance team (office hours) and emergency 24-hour maintenance service - Professionally designed and maintained private landscaped courtyards - Onsite security 24 Hours - Access to M50 Motorway - Route 9 Bus every 10 minutes to City Centre. One months deposit and one months rent in advance is required. Please note this is unfurnished apartment.\n\nMore information at www.i-res.ie.\n\nAs an I-RES resident, you can be assured of: - Reliable professional service, when you need it - Fully trained staff to support you at every stage - Own inhouse maintenance team - 24-hour on-call support for emergencies such as loss of heat, water or essential services - Clear communications and point of contact via our resident portal We aim to reply to all emails as soon as possible, however as we receive a large number of enquiries, we may not be able to reply individually to all messages. If you do not hear from us within 48 hours, we regret that we are unable to assist you at this time.\n\nProspect Privacy Notice: Personal data you submit in the contact form is processed by I-RES according to applicable laws and our privacy statement https://www.iresreit.ie/IRES-REIT-Privacy",
